{"title": "Shadow-Cursed Undead (Condition)", "pageid": 10944, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Undead_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has stack type", "Has status properties", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Shadow-Cursed_Undead_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Shadow-Cursed_Undead_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Shadow-Cursed_Undead_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Shadow-Cursed_Undead_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Shadow-Cursed_Undead_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Shadow-Cursed_Undead_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadow-Cursed Undead Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Shadow-Cursed_Undead_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Shadow-Cursed_Undead_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Shadow-Cursed_Undead_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Shadow-Cursed Undead</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Those who die in the shadows are cursed to remain there forever.</li>\n<li>These undead have reduced <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">Hit Points</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a>, are <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_Types\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Types\">Resistant</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> damage and cannot use <a href=\"/wiki/Spell\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell\">Spells</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Weapon_Actions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon Actions\">Weapon Actions</a>. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">SCL_SHADOW_CURSE_UNDEAD</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CSCL_SHADOW_CURSE_UNDEAD%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CSCL_SHADOW_CURSE_UNDEAD%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Stack_type\" title=\"Conditions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png/25px-Sort_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png/38px-Sort_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"If already applied\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png/25px-Sort_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Stack_type\" title=\"Conditions\">If already applied</a>: do not apply\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/DisableOverhead\" title=\"Status properties/DisableOverhead\">DisableOverhead</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/DisableCombatlog\" title=\"Status properties/DisableCombatlog\">DisableCombatlog</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/DisablePortraitIndicator\" title=\"Status properties/DisablePortraitIndicator\">DisablePortraitIndicator</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/ApplyToDead\" title=\"Status properties/ApplyToDead\">ApplyToDead</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/LoseControl\" title=\"Status properties/LoseControl\">LoseControl</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/IgnoreResting\" title=\"Status properties/IgnoreResting\">IgnoreResting</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Warning_Icon.png/25px-Warning_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/71/Warning_Icon.png/38px-Warning_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/7/71/Warning_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Warning Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Warning_Icon.png/25px-Warning_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/71/Warning_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <span style=\"color: #EB2C60;\">An affected party member is fully controlled by the game's AI, which may behave in unexpected ways.</span></li>\n<li>Attacks by affected entities deal an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">2d4+2</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> damage.</li>\n<li>Creature type and race are changed to <a href=\"/wiki/Undead\" title=\"Undead\">undead</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Zombie\" title=\"Zombie\">zombie</a>. Reverts back to original type and race when creature loses this condition.</li>\n<li>⚠️This condition is removed along with the <a href=\"/wiki/Polymorphed_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorphed (Condition)\">Polymorphed_(Condition)</a> condition if you damage an object that has been transformed into a sheep (works in patch #6).</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Shadow-Cursed_Undead\">Sources of Shadow-Cursed Undead</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"min-width: 30px;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Umbral_Influx_(Condition)\" title=\"Umbral Influx (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Umbral Influx\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/60/Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Umbral_Influx_(Condition)\" title=\"Umbral Influx (Condition)\">Umbral Influx</a></span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Curse\" title=\"Shadow Curse\">Shadow Curse</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creatures_with_Shadow-Cursed_Undead\">Creatures with Shadow-Cursed Undead</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cursed_Kuo-Toa_(melee)\" title=\"Cursed Kuo-Toa (melee)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Portrait_Cursed_Kuo-Toa_%28melee%29.png/30px-Portrait_Cursed_Kuo-Toa_%28melee%29.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Portrait_Cursed_Kuo-Toa_%28melee%29.png/45px-Portrait_Cursed_Kuo-Toa_%28melee%29.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Portrait_Cursed_Kuo-Toa_%28melee%29.png/60px-Portrait_Cursed_Kuo-Toa_%28melee%29.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cursed Kuo-Toa (melee)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Portrait_Cursed_Kuo-Toa_%28melee%29.png/30px-Portrait_Cursed_Kuo-Toa_%28melee%29.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/be/Portrait_Cursed_Kuo-Toa_%28melee%29.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cursed_Kuo-Toa_(melee)\" title=\"Cursed Kuo-Toa (melee)\">Cursed Kuo-Toa (melee)</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cursed_Kuo-Toa_(ranged)\" title=\"Cursed Kuo-Toa (ranged)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Portrait_Cursed_Kuo-Toa_%28ranged%29.png/30px-Portrait_Cursed_Kuo-Toa_%28ranged%29.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Portrait_Cursed_Kuo-Toa_%28ranged%29.png/45px-Portrait_Cursed_Kuo-Toa_%28ranged%29.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Portrait_Cursed_Kuo-Toa_%28ranged%29.png/60px-Portrait_Cursed_Kuo-Toa_%28ranged%29.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cursed Kuo-Toa (ranged)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Portrait_Cursed_Kuo-Toa_%28ranged%29.png/30px-Portrait_Cursed_Kuo-Toa_%28ranged%29.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" clas