/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Fist_%28Portal%29_1.png/30px-Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Fist_%28Portal%29_1.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Fist_%28Portal%29_1.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Flaming_Fist\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Flaming Fist\">Shadow-Cursed Flaming Fist</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Githyanki_Warrior\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Githyanki Warrior\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Githyanki_%28Portal%29_3.png/30px-Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Githyanki_%28Portal%29_3.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Githyanki_%28Portal%29_3.png/45px-Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Githyanki_%28Portal%29_3.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Githyanki_%28Portal%29_3.png/60px-Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Githyanki_%28Portal%29_3.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadow-Cursed Githyanki Warrior\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Githyanki_%28Portal%29_3.png/30px-Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Githyanki_%28Portal%29_3.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d3/Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Githyanki_%28Portal%29_3.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Githyanki_Warrior\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Githyanki Warrior\">Shadow-Cursed Githyanki Warrior</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Harper\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Harper\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f8/Portrait_Shadow-Cursed